MonitorSummaryDTO.description:
`GET /clients/{id}/monitor` — always returns a meaningful shape, even
for a client with zero runs yet (task-35 DoD): counts are all `0`,
`last_light_run`/`last_full_run` are `None`, never a 404/500.

ReportBatchClientRowDTO.description:
One row of the batch progress matrix (task-47 §2.4/§3.4) — enough to
render "4/6 periods, Running, 0:42" without a second request per client;
"Open document"/"Client PDF" link to the existing run-detail routes.
